  "comment_colors": "Panel base is a brushed-charcoal vertical gradient: a hint of warm highlight at the top, mid-grey body, deeper graphite at the bottom. Per-monitor variants nudge the body shade to break up the stack so cpu/mem/net don't look like one tall panel."
